    "body": "Thanks for your report! Starship versions below v1.4.0 should be unaffected.\r\n\r\nThe aws module was changed to only display if credentials or a `credential_process` have been set up. This did not support some credential methods, and I believe `source_profile` is not supported by the parser in the module.\r\n\r\nTherefore, #3718 has added SSO support and #3720 will add an option to force display.",
